1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,568
Forward Deployed Delivery helps technical
professionals practice the transition to end-to-end

2
00:00:05,638 --> 00:00:07,067
delivery ownership.

3
00:00:07,137 --> 00:00:12,407
Follow one fictional support engagement
through discovery, framing, a working review

4
00:00:12,477 --> 00:00:16,381
prototype, evidence-based
decisions, adoption, and reuse.

5
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:19,437
Then transfer the method
to a maintenance capstone.

6
00:00:19,507 --> 00:00:25,118
The course includes thirty-six lessons, a
guided coding lab, reusable templates, worked

7
00:00:25,188 --> 00:00:28,452
answers, captions, and a
complete Spanish edition.

8
00:00:28,522 --> 00:00:30,229
Some coding is required.

9
00:00:30,299 --> 00:00:34,437
No paid AI account is needed
for the supplied rule-based lab.

10
00:00:34,507 --> 00:00:40,353
You will build a simulated deployment portfolio
and a plan for gathering real field evidence.

11
00:00:40,423 --> 00:00:45,649
Course completion describes educational
achievement, without accredited certification or

12
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:47,533
guaranteed career outcomes.

13
00:00:47,603 --> 00:00:49,885
Narration uses synthetic voices.

14
00:00:49,955 --> 00:00:53,049
Begin with the preview lesson
to see the learning approach.
